<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Block Journal</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap');

    :root {
      --sky: #8fd1ff;
      --grass-light: #9bd680;
      --grass: #6fa453;
      --dirt: #4b3522;
      --wood: #caa76b;
      --wood-dark: #3b2816;
      --stone: #5c6b70;
      --outline: #1c1207;
      --parchment: #f1e3c4;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--sky) 0%, var(--sky) 55%, var(--grass-light) 55%, var(--grass) 58%, #5f8a41 60%, var(--dirt) 100%);
      font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;
      color: #f7f0d0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-size: 12px 12px;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      z-index: 1;
    }

    body::after {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 110px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(#5f8a41 0 18px, #4f7436 18px 26px, var(--dirt) 26px 110px),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0 16px, transparent 16px 32px);
      box-shadow: 0 -10px 0 #2d1a0c;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .cloud-layer {
      position: fixed;
      top: 28px;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .cloud {
      position: absolute;
      width: 96px;
      height: 32px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow:
        16px 0 0 #fff,
        32px 0 0 #fff,
        48px 0 0 #fff,
        0 -16px 0 #fff,
        16px -16px 0 #fff,
        32px -16px 0 #fff,
        16px 16px 0 #fff,
        32px 16px 0 #fff;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 140px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      padding: 32px 24px 40px;
      background: var(--wood);
      border: 6px solid var(--outline);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px #f0d7a1, 0 12px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      position: relative;
    }

    header::before,
    header::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      background: #e0c27b;
      border: 3px solid var(--outline);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #f7e5b9;
    }

    header::before { top: -14px; left: 18px; }
    header::after { bottom: -14px; right: 18px; }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      color: var(--outline);
      text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #f0d7a1;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      color: #275018;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #f7e5b9;
    }

    .health-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 32px 0;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6f5535 0%, #4d331c 100%);
      border: 6px solid var(--outline);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #d4b883 inset, 0 12px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .health-label {
      color: #f0d7a1;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .health-container {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .pixel-heart {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      background: #d82128;
      box-shadow:
        10px 0 #d82128,
        20px 0 #d82128,
        0 10px #d82128,
        10px 10px #ff4f56,
        20px 10px #ff4f56,
        30px 10px #d82128,
        -10px 10px #d82128,
        0 20px #d82128,
        10px 20px #ff4f56,
        20px 20px #ff4f56,
        30px 20px #d82128,
        -10px 20px #d82128,
        0 30px #d82128,
        10px 30px #d82128,
        20px 30px #d82128,
        10px 40px #d82128;
      transform: scale(0.55);
      transform-origin: left top;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 0 #541515);
      animation: throb 1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .pixel-heart.empty {
      filter: grayscale(1) brightness(0.45);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    @keyframes throb {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.55); }
      50% { transform: scale(0.6); }
    }

    .menu-box {
      background: #494949;
      border: 6px solid var(--outline);
      margin: 24px 0 32px;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #9ea9a3 inset, 0 12px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    .menu-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 6px;
      left: 6px;
      right: 6px;
      bottom: 6px;
      border: 3px solid #282828;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .menu-title {
      background: #2f2f2f;
      color: #d2f89b;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      display: inline-block;
      position: absolute;
      top: -16px;
      left: 24px;
      border: 4px solid var(--outline);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #9ea9a3 inset;
    }

    .menu-content {
      padding: 32px 26px 26px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .menu-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #3b3b3b;
      border: 4px solid #1c1c1c;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #6f6f6f, inset 0 0 0 6px #2a2a2a;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease, border-color 0.1s ease;
    }

    .menu-item:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: #d2f89b;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #d2f89b, inset 0 0 0 6px #2a2a2a, 0 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .arrow {
      color: #d2f89b;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #1c1c1c;
    }

    .item-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      background: #c8b381;
      border: 4px solid var(--outline);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #f0d7a1;
    }

    .item-text {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .item-name {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: #e9f6c1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .item-desc {
      font-size: 0.55rem;
      color: #c7d0bf;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .stats-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }

    .stat-box {
      background: #4a4a4a;
      border: 6px solid #1c1c1c;
      padding: 18px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #7a8384 inset, 0 10px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .stat-icon {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #d2f89b;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .stat-name {
      font-size: 0.55rem;
      color: #dcdcdc;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .pixel-divider {
      height: 14px;
      margin: 36px 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(#7db95f 0 50%, #5b3c23 50% 100%),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0 12px, transparent 12px 24px);
      border: 4px solid var(--outline);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #caa76b inset;
    }

    .quest-log {
      background: var(--parchment);
      border: 6px solid #6b4b2c;
      padding: 26px;
      margin: 32px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px #f9f1dc inset, 0 10px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      color: #2e2114;
    }

    .quest-log h3 {
      color: #6b4b2c;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .quest-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #d3c09b;
    }

    .quest-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .quest-checkbox {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border: 3px solid #6b4b2c;
      background: #caa76b;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: #6b4b2c;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #f9e4c5;
    }

    .quest-checkbox.complete {
      background: #7bcf6b;
      border-color: #2f5c2a;
      color: #0e2a0e;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #bde6a8;
    }

    .quest-text {
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: #2e2114;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: var(--wood);
      border: 6px solid var(--outline);
      color: var(--outline);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #f0d7a1 inset, 0 10px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      transition: transform 0.1s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .back-link:active {
      transform: translateY(0);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #f0d7a1 inset, 0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 48px;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #d4c6a5;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #332719;
    }

    footer p {
      font-size: 0.55rem;
    }

    .coin {
      display: inline-block;
      animation: spin-coin 1s steps(8) infinite;
    }

    @keyframes spin-coin {
      0% { transform: scaleX(1); }
      50% { transform: scaleX(-1); }
      100% { transform: scaleX(1); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cloud-layer">
    <div class="cloud" style="top: 34px; left: 8%;"></div>
    <div class="cloud" style="top: 78px; left: 32%;"></div>
    <div class="cloud" style="top: 26px; left: 62%;"></div>
    <div class="cloud" style="top: 110px; left: 78%;"></div>
    <div class="cloud" style="top: 140px; left: 12%;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>BLOCK JOURNAL</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">SURVIVAL MODE · PIXEL EDITION</p>
    </header>

    <div class="health-bar">
      <span class="health-label">HEALTH</span>
      <div class="health-container">
        <div class="pixel-heart"></div>
        <div class="pixel-heart"></div>
        <div class="pixel-heart"></div>
        <div class="pixel-heart empty"></div>
        <div class="pixel-heart empty"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-box">
      <span class="menu-title">INVENTORY</span>
      <div class="menu-content">
        <div class="menu-item">
          <span class="arrow">▶</span>
          <span class="item-icon">⛏️</span>
          <div class="item-text">
            <div class="item-name">NEW WORLD</div>
            <div class="item-desc">Generate a fresh blocky adventure</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-item">
          <span class="arrow">▶</span>
          <span class="item-icon">🗺️</span>
          <div class="item-text">
            <div class="item-name">LOAD WORLD</div>
            <div class="item-desc">Resume your saved chunks</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-item">
          <span class="arrow">▶</span>
          <span class="item-icon">⚙️</span>
          <div class="item-text">
            <div class="item-name">GAME RULES</div>
            <div class="item-desc">Adjust survival settings & packs</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-section">
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon">💎</div>
        <div class="stat-value">64</div>
        <div class="stat-name">EMERALDS</div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon">✨</div>
        <div class="stat-value">LV.30</div>
        <div class="stat-name">XP LEVEL</div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon">⛏️</div>
        <div class="stat-value">12,480</div>
        <div class="stat-name">BLOCKS MINED</div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon">🌾</div>
        <div class="stat-value">PLAINS</div>
        <div class="stat-name">CURRENT BIOME</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pixel-divider"></div>

    <div class="quest-log">
      <h3>📖 QUEST LOG</h3>

      <div class="quest-item">
        <div class="quest-checkbox complete">✓</div>
        <div class="quest-text">Punch a tree and craft your first planks</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quest-item">
        <div class="quest-checkbox complete">✓</div>
        <div class="quest-text">Light up the starter base with torches</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quest-item">
        <div class="quest-checkbox"></div>
        <div class="quest-text">Smelt iron and craft a shield</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quest-item">
        <div class="quest-checkbox"></div>
        <div class="quest-text">Find a fortress and brew awkward potions</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← BACK TO VILLAGE</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>Remember to sleep before the phantoms swoop.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;">© BLOCK JOURNAL · KEEP IT CHUNKY</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
